  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum Mod。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>一键亮度切换是一款客户端模组，允许玩家通过按下一个按钮立即将亮度（伽马值）调至最大。默认按键是 G，但可以在选项 -&gt; 控制中进行更改。本模组源于一位视力不佳玩家的请求，他需要此功能来游玩游戏。请勿在禁止该功能的服务器上使用。如有疑问，请先询问。<br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg&w=718\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 客户端整合包中\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>功能演示：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/full-brightness-toggle/a.webp\" alt=\"gif0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><strong>按键绑定可在游戏内选项菜单中更改：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/full-brightness-toggle/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"579\"></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用本模组，前提是下载链接仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
